WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.664 --> 00:00:16.557
Roxy watched with horror as demons filled Metro City Park.

2
00:00:19.279 --> 00:00:23.043
Armed with spears, swords, and axes, they cackled with delight.

3
00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:28.768
"They must have traveled through the portal," Wukong said.

4
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.102
The Demon of Black Rain joined the other demons, and then looked around and smiled.

5
00:00:34.122 --> 00:00:39.325
"This looks like a great kingdom—now it's mine!"

6
00:00:39.345 --> 00:00:45.248
"No, it's not," Wukong said as he twirled his iron bar.

7
00:00:45.268 --> 00:00:50.471
"You're not welcome here," Roxy added, narrowing her eyes.

8
00:00:51.472 --> 00:00:54.413
Bajie waved his rake while Wujing held up his spear.

9
00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:56.634
Jack's eyes went wide.

10
00:00:56.654 --> 00:00:59.436
"Cool. They look like warriors!"

11
00:01:00.652 --> 00:01:01.852
The Tang Monk grabbed him.

12
00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:03.673
"We need to hide!"

13
00:01:07.314 --> 00:01:10.215
The monk, Mara, Jack, and Terrell hid behind shrubs.

14
00:01:12.395 --> 00:01:15.176
The demons approached, stomping all over the picnic food.

15
00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:20.317
"Attack!" Wukong cried, charging toward the Demon of Black Rain.

16
00:01:21.298 --> 00:01:24.479
Roxy followed him while Bajie and Wujing fought smaller demons.

17
00:01:24.499 --> 00:01:29.300
"How dare you try to take over this city!"

18
00:01:30.036 --> 00:01:31.597
Bajie struck a demon with his rake.

19
00:01:32.598 --> 00:01:34.500
Poof! The demon turned to smoke.

20
00:01:35.841 --> 00:01:38.903
Poof! Wujing chuckled as he destroyed another demon.

21
00:01:39.964 --> 00:01:42.486
Wukong and Roxy flew toward the Demon of Black Rain.

22
00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:45.068
But a gust of wind blew them back.

23
00:01:45.929 --> 00:01:48.651
They crashed into a fence as rain poured down on them.

24
00:01:48.671 --> 00:01:52.715
"Ugh!" Wukong said, getting back on his feet.

25
00:01:52.735 --> 00:01:56.998
"I forgot about the demon's terrible wind and rain magic."

26
00:01:58.399 --> 00:01:59.020
Roxy nodded.

27
00:02:00.088 --> 00:02:03.370
"But don't worry—I can use my freeze breath to freeze the rain."

28
00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.391
"Whoa!" Wukong said.

29
00:02:06.411 --> 00:02:08.812
"I wish I had freeze breath!"

30
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:11.833
They charged toward the demon again.

31
00:02:13.874 --> 00:02:15.975
As wind and rain swirled, Roxy blew.

32
00:02:16.755 --> 00:02:19.917
Whoo-oo-oosh! The demon held up a small jar.

33
00:02:20.597 --> 00:02:23.198
Roxy's freeze breath went into the jar and disappeared.

34
00:02:23.218 --> 00:02:26.880
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

35
00:02:27.748 --> 00:02:31.951
Wind and rain whipped toward her and Wukong, and again they were thrown backward.

36
00:02:31.971 --> 00:02:38.635
"Grr!" Once more Roxy flew toward the demon and blew.

37
00:02:39.135 --> 00:02:43.178
Whoo-oo-oosh! The jar caught the freeze breath again.

38
00:02:44.699 --> 00:02:48.141
Roxy tumbled in the wind, crashing through the fence and landing behind a bush.

39
00:02:49.442 --> 00:02:50.323
The demon laughed.

40
00:02:55.776 --> 00:02:58.337
"I am getting so angry!"

41
00:02:58.817 --> 00:03:00.437
Roxy cried, stamping her foot.

42
00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.518
Wukong tapped her on the shoulder.

43
00:03:03.538 --> 00:03:07.179
"Rocket Girl, I have a plan," he whispered in her ear.

44
00:03:07.939 --> 00:03:09.880
Roxy chuckled as Wukong explained.

45
00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:13.361
"I love it," she said.

46
00:03:14.461 --> 00:03:16.682
Wukong and Roxy jumped out from behind the bush.

47
00:03:17.562 --> 00:03:20.103
They rushed toward the demon as he conjured more wind and rain.

48
00:03:20.123 --> 00:03:23.483
"You two should just give up!"

49
00:03:25.376 --> 00:03:26.537
the demon said, laughing.

50
00:03:27.357 --> 00:03:29.639
"I'm too powerful!"

51
00:03:30.819 --> 00:03:32.000
Roxy took a deep breath.

52
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.422
Wukong took a deep breath.

53
00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:38.383
They both blew.

54
00:03:40.285 --> 00:03:44.627
The demon held up the jar toward Roxy—and Wukong's breath blasted the demon.

55
00:03:45.728 --> 00:03:48.089
The swirling rain instantly froze around him.

56
00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.011
The demon struggled to break free.

57
00:03:51.031 --> 00:03:53.192
"What happened?"

58
00:03:54.536 --> 00:03:55.297
Light sparkled.

59
00:03:56.077 --> 00:03:59.260
Roxy turned into Wukong, and Wukong turned into Roxy.

60
00:04:00.081 --> 00:04:00.882
Roxy laughed.

61
00:04:00.902 --> 00:04:04.204
"Wukong made us look like each other!"

62
00:04:04.224 --> 00:04:06.086
Wukong grinned.

63
00:04:06.106 --> 00:04:08.388
"And now you're stuck!"

64
00:04:10.189 --> 00:04:14.273
Pow! Roxy knocked over the demon and held down his icy cage.

65
00:04:15.654 --> 00:04:17.896
Wukong raised his iron bar, ready to strike.

66
00:04:18.636 --> 00:04:21.119
"I'll destroy you, once and for all!"

67
00:04:24.308 --> 00:04:25.329
"Help!" Mara suddenly cried.

68
00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.312
Both Roxy and Wukong looked over.

69
00:04:29.413 --> 00:04:32.696
Nasty-looking demons surrounded Roxy's friends and the Tang Monk!
